Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":12,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":242,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1884854,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281944,"Name":"Teg07","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281944.jpg?_r=1422582035","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":289,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1422785384,"LastPoster":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1404747402","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1884854,"PostDate":1422785384,"PostContent":"Hi Fellow brides ...still trying  to figure out the ins And outs of the forum But so far I'm hook...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tegz1177@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422551835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281944.jpg?_r=1422582035","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":289,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Teg07","Id":281944,"Name":"Teg07","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d4a0e21b7928a6201538925511c21e3","RawContent":"Hi Fellow brides ...still trying  to figure out the ins And outs of the forum But so far I&#039;m hooked.   I&#039;m booked at Azul Fives for a sky deck wedding on October 7th2015. Trying to decide on photography options but feeling lost. Do any past brides have any comments about the approved Karisma photographers Caribe &amp;amp; Matais Cano? \n\nI see from the Azul Fives 2015 brides forum that many have chosen outside vendors. Can anyone share their experience searching for and booking an outside photographer ?","Attachments":[],"Id":1884854,"PostDate":1422785384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Fellow brides ...still trying  to figure out the ins And outs of the forum But so far I'm hooked.   I'm booked at Azul Fives for a sky deck wedding on October 7th2015. Trying to decide on photography options but feeling lost. Do any past brides have any comments about the approved Karisma photographers Caribe & Matais Cano? <br>\nI see from the Azul Fives 2015 brides forum that many have chosen outside vendors. Can anyone share their experience searching for and booking an outside photographer ?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tegz1177@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422551835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281944.jpg?_r=1422582035","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":289,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Teg07","Id":281944,"Name":"Teg07","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61ae9ec11acc27507d42aecf5a0053d3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We decided to go with an outside photographer because we found a better deal than the approved photographers, that&#039;s even considering the $800 outside vendor fee. I think the main thing is to look for different photographers and their work, see what kind of style you like better and then start asking for quotes. It is kind of time consuming and it&#039;s always a trade off between what you like and what you can\/are willing to pay.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We booked Octavio Montes and the booking process was really easy. We paid our deposit for photos and video with Paypal and he was always super responsive. In hindsight I would have asked some more questions before booking but I really don&#039;t regret my decision. There&#039;s some really good questions to ask here under booking a photographer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.buzzfeed.com\/peggy\/these-diagrams-are-everything-you-need-to-plan-your-wedding?bffbweddings&amp;amp;bffb&amp;amp;utm_term=4ldqpkk#.yirKWJ29n&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.buzzfeed.com\/peggy\/these-diagrams-are-everything-you-need-to-plan-your-wedding?bffbweddings&amp;amp;bffb&amp;amp;utm_term=4ldqpkk#.yirKWJ29n&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884864,"PostDate":1422792434,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We decided to go with an outside photographer because we found a better deal than the approved photographers, that's even considering the $800 outside vendor fee. I think the main thing is to look for different photographers and their work, see what kind of style you like better and then start asking for quotes. It is kind of time consuming and it's always a trade off between what you like and what you can\/are willing to pay.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We booked Octavio Montes and the booking process was really easy. We paid our deposit for photos and video with Paypal and he was always super responsive. In hindsight I would have asked some more questions before booking but I really don't regret my decision. There's some really good questions to ask here under booking a photographer:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.buzzfeed.com\/peggy\/these-diagrams-are-everything-you-need-to-plan-your-wedding?bffbweddings&bffb&utm_term=4ldqpkk#.yirKWJ29n' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.buzzfeed....qpkk#.yirKWJ29n<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359734304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1404747402","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"179.53.134.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 02 February 2015 - 07:58 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1422863904,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e1f338fff3b9dbfaf8c67b35a5c5865","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the boards, Teg07, and Congrats on your upcoming Azul Fives Wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The last we heard from Azul Fives was that they required the photography team to have day passes to enter the resort and photograph the wedding. However, it&#039;s best to confirm with your wedding coordinator what their latest requirement is, to ensure you have the latest info.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you considered adding a Cenote TTD to your photography record? It&#039;s been a highlight for many of our wedding couples, so could be something to consider.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a visual to inspire you further...with more at this link: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos&lt;\/a&gt;...enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans, cheers! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884927,"PostDate":1422863805,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the boards, Teg07, and Congrats on your upcoming Azul Fives Wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The last we heard from Azul Fives was that they required the photography team to have day passes to enter the resort and photograph the wedding. However, it's best to confirm with your wedding coordinator what their latest requirement is, to ensure you have the latest info.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you considered adding a Cenote TTD to your photography record? It's been a highlight for many of our wedding couples, so could be something to consider.<\/p>\n<p>Here's a visual to inspire you further...with more at this link: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos<\/a>...enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans, cheers! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.36.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14533cac039479f11fa784327e83207e","RawContent":"Thanks for the link @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]! In hindsight I should have asked those questions too but I got excited lol. No regrets for me as well","Attachments":[],"Id":1884942,"PostDate":1422868775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the link @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a>! In hindsight I should have asked those questions too but I got excited lol. No regrets for me as well\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81dac38656e9bd46045a88180db9f357","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1884864\" timestamp=\"1422821234\"]\nWe decided to go with an outside photographer because we found a better deal than the approved photographers, that&#039;s even considering the $800 outside vendor fee. I think the main thing is to look for different photographers and their work, see what kind of style you like better and then start asking for quotes. It is kind of time consuming and it&#039;s always a trade off between what you like and what you can\/are willing to pay. \n \nWe booked Octavio Montes and the booking process was really easy. We paid our deposit for photos and video with Paypal and he was always super responsive. In hindsight I would have asked some more questions before booking but I really don&#039;t regret my decision. There&#039;s some really good questions to ask here under booking a photographer: \n \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.buzzfeed.com\/peggy\/these-diagrams-are-everything-you-need-to-plan-your-wedding?bffbweddings&amp;amp;bffb&amp;amp;utm_term=4ldqpkk#.yirKWJ29n\"]http:\/\/www.buzzfeed.com\/peggy\/these-diagrams-are-everything-you-need-to-plan-your-wedding?bffbweddings&amp;amp;bffb&amp;amp;utm_term=4ldqpkk#.yirKWJ29n[\/url][\/quote]Thank you for your feedback. We are thinking that outside might be the way to go to get what we love at price that makes sense. It definitely is a process but we think we might like to work with Pixan photography.  Ive been in contact with them and so far so good and I have found great reviews. \n\nThe article you posted is wonderful....so much useful info! \n\nnext question for you ......did you get flowers from Lomas ? I&#039;m debating between doing silk and bringing my own bouquets.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885495,"PostDate":1423230329,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 01 February 2015 - 12:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We decided to go with an outside photographer because we found a better deal than the approved photographers, that's even considering the $800 outside vendor fee. I think the main thing is to look for different photographers and their work, see what kind of style you like better and then start asking for quotes. It is kind of time consuming and it's always a trade off between what you like and what you can\/are willing to pay.\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe booked Octavio Montes and the booking process was really easy. We paid our deposit for photos and video with Paypal and he was always super responsive. In hindsight I would have asked some more questions before booking but I really don't regret my decision. There's some really good questions to ask here under booking a photographer:\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/www.buzzfeed.com\/peggy\/these-diagrams-are-everything-you-need-to-plan-your-wedding?bffbweddings&bffb&utm_term=4ldqpkk#.yirKWJ29n' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.buzzfeed....qpkk#.yirKWJ29n<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you for your feedback. We are thinking that outside might be the way to go to get what we love at price that makes sense. It definitely is a process but we think we might like to work with Pixan photography.  Ive been in contact with them and so far so good and I have found great reviews. <br><br>\nThe article you posted is wonderful....so much useful info! <br><br>\nnext question for you ......did you get flowers from Lomas ? I'm debating between doing silk and bringing my own bouquets.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tegz1177@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422551835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281944.jpg?_r=1422582035","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":289,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Teg07","Id":281944,"Name":"Teg07","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aae90287ffa05cf65cd2aa335cca8602","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Teg07\"] I really wish I had come across that article sooner! haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m only getting my bouquet from Lomas and we&#039;re bringing everything else from here. I just couldn&#039;t make it past their prices, they&#039;re way too high for just flowers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885505,"PostDate":1423233997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281944\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281944-teg07\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Teg07<\/span><\/a> I really wish I had come across that article sooner! haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm only getting my bouquet from Lomas and we're bringing everything else from here. I just couldn't make it past their prices, they're way too high for just flowers.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359734304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1404747402","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.179.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a48a5be9bd85e4fa19b7d159428b2ef","RawContent":"We&#039;ve just confirmed with Samuel Luna. His work is gorgeous and I think for what he offers his prices are good.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885509,"PostDate":1423237238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We've just confirmed with Samuel Luna. His work is gorgeous and I think for what he offers his prices are good.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283430199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1393821808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a7bcf3e68bb1a49d37e44cb5ba41281","RawContent":"@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] I fully agree about the prices ......it&#039;s just too much. I&#039;m planning an at home reception 2 weeks after we return so I figure I will use real flowers then at a fraction of the cost. \n\nI like the idea of just buying the brides bouquets from Lomas and bringing the rest. I only have 3 bridesmaids so it won&#039;t be much to travel with. \n\nHow are you planning to decorate for your ceremony?  I&#039;m guessing your are bringing most with you?","Attachments":[],"Id":1885566,"PostDate":1423306284,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> I fully agree about the prices ......it's just too much. I'm planning an at home reception 2 weeks after we return so I figure I will use real flowers then at a fraction of the cost. <br>\nI like the idea of just buying the brides bouquets from Lomas and bringing the rest. I only have 3 bridesmaids so it won't be much to travel with. <br>\nHow are you planning to decorate for your ceremony?  I'm guessing your are bringing most with you?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tegz1177@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422551835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281944.jpg?_r=1422582035","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":289,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Teg07","Id":281944,"Name":"Teg07","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1c3acaf89e9c23cbbd80e2a6065a938","RawContent":"I have two bridesmaids and fianc\u00e9 has his two sisters on his side so I need four little bouquets which I bought at Michael&#039;s. I&#039;m paying for their vintage elegance decor for the tables so I&#039;m just bringing the centerpieces (I attached a picture of how they&#039;d look) the little blue round thing is a filled cookie, our favor, which we will put inside the boxes. \n\n\nThen I&#039;ll have some extra decor for the guest book table but I will keep it simple. And I bought some pomanders the other day at Michael&#039;s for the aisle for the ceremony and that&#039;s pretty much all I&#039;m bringing in terms of decor. I haven&#039;t had a chance to take a picture of the pomanders. Maybe I should start a planning thread :) \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\nHaha forgot the pictures. I also attached one of what our sweetheart table will look like but you have to use your imagination a bit for that one haha [attachment=30545:ImageUploadedByTapatalk1423372951.298974.jpg]\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[{"Id":30545,"Name":"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1423372951.298974.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-265511-142337198622.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-265511-142337198622_thumb.jpg","Width":480,"Height":640}],"Id":1885607,"PostDate":1423343283,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have two bridesmaids and fianc\u00e9 has his two sisters on his side so I need four little bouquets which I bought at Michael's. I'm paying for their vintage elegance decor for the tables so I'm just bringing the centerpieces (I attached a picture of how they'd look) the little blue round thing is a filled cookie, our favor, which we will put inside the boxes. <br><br>\nThen I'll have some extra decor for the guest book table but I will keep it simple. And I bought some pomanders the other day at Michael's for the aisle for the ceremony and that's pretty much all I'm bringing in terms of decor. I haven't had a chance to take a picture of the pomanders. Maybe I should start a planning thread <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/>Haha forgot the pictures. I also attached one of what our sweetheart table will look like but you have to use your imagination a bit for that one haha [<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885607]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-265511-142337207875.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1423373043.638554.jpg - Size: 271.09KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-265511-142337207875.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1423373043.638554.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\nattachment=30545:ImageUploadedByTapatalk1423372951.298974.jpg]<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885607]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-265511-142337200532.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1423372970.382511.jpg - Size: 276.19KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-265511-142337200532.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1423372970.382511.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359734304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1404747402","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.214.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ee444c112a29777afbebc8462a1e065","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Teg07\" post=\"1884854\" timestamp=\"1422814184\"]\nHi Fellow brides ...still trying to figure out the ins And outs of the forum But so far I&#039;m hooked. I&#039;m booked at Azul Fives for a sky deck wedding on October 7th2015. Trying to decide on photography options but feeling lost. Do any past brides have any comments about the approved Karisma photographers Caribe &amp;amp; Matais Cano?\nI see from the Azul Fives 2015 brides forum that many have chosen outside vendors. Can anyone share their experience searching for and booking an outside photographer ?[\/quote]Hi there,\n\nWelcome to the forum.\n\nIt is such a difficult decision to make. Especially for the most important day of your life...budget is important ,but its also a trust issue.Purchasing a product ahead of time and online is always difficult.\n\nI think it is very important to have a good line of open and honest communication,skype dates,phone calls all help enable one to make a happy informed decision.\n\nRegards\nAlexis","Attachments":[],"Id":1885907,"PostDate":1423567378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Teg07, on 01 February 2015 - 10:09 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Fellow brides ...still trying to figure out the ins And outs of the forum But so far I'm hooked. I'm booked at Azul Fives for a sky deck wedding on October 7th2015. Trying to decide on photography options but feeling lost. Do any past brides have any comments about the approved Karisma photographers Caribe & Matais Cano?<br>\nI see from the Azul Fives 2015 brides forum that many have chosen outside vendors. Can anyone share their experience searching for and booking an outside photographer ?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi there,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Welcome to the forum.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is such a difficult decision to make. Especially for the most important day of your life...budget is important ,but its also a trust issue.Purchasing a product ahead of time and online is always difficult.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think it is very important to have a good line of open and honest communication,skype dates,phone calls all help enable one to make a happy informed decision.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Regards<\/p>\n<p>Alexis<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Please <strong>click<\/strong> on the 5 thumbnail images below to view more info on each topic.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com\/portfolio-1-weddings'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01weddings-and-great-moments-pixan.jpg\" alt=\"01weddings-and-great-moments-pixan.jpg\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com\/portfolio-7-trash-the-dress'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/amazing-trash-the-dress-pixan-photography.jpg\" alt=\"amazing-trash-the-dress-pixan-photograph\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01pixan-photography-logo-bdwf.jpg\" alt=\"01pixan-photography-logo-bdwf.jpg\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/mad.ly\/cabe64'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01download-our-wedding-welcome-guide-pixan.jpg\" alt=\"01download-our-wedding-welcome-guide-pix\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/mad.ly\/3112b4'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01pixan-riviera-maya-honeymoon-photo-adventure.jpg\" alt=\"01pixan-riviera-maya-honeymoon-photo-adv\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pixanphoto'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pixanphotograph\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Pinterest.png\" alt=\"Pinterest.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/vimeo.com\/pixanphotography'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Vimeo.png\" alt=\"Vimeo.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/plus.google.com\/u\/0\/102756607804404106269\/posts'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Google+.png\" alt=\"Google+.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/skype'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Skype.png\" alt=\"Skype.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/pixan-photography'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/LinkedIn.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Wordpress.png\" alt=\"Wordpress.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Public Relations<\/strong> |<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#66cccc;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pixan Photography<\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:#add8e6;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">|<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:georgina@pixanphoto.com'><span style=\"color:#a9a9a9;\">georgina<\/span><\/a><\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:georgina@pixanphoto.com'><span style=\"color:#a9a9a9;\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">@pixanphoto.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;\">|<strong> <\/strong><\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com'><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(245,177,71);\">www.pixanphoto.com<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"georgina@pixanphoto.com","IpAddress":"201.166.29.36","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1398703002,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277766.jpg?_r=1411686578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PixanPhotography","Id":277766,"Name":"PixanPhotography","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78716","Title":"Azul Fives Bride Looking For Photography Guidance !","LastPostDate":1423589904},"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
