{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30507290113bee0c4d8d3fca8c977fec","RawContent":"@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] - The tables look wonderful ! My cousin used those lanterns from ikea at her wedding and I have it as a momento. :) \n\nAs for the flowers ...they also look great. I&#039;m impressed with how real they look . I&#039;m going to check out Michaels myself this week to see what they have. \n\nSeeing all your stuff makes me feel excited .....You should definitely start a planning thread :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1885955,"PostDate":1423582970,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> - The tables look wonderful ! My cousin used those lanterns from ikea at her wedding and I have it as a momento. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br>\nAs for the flowers ...they also look great. I'm impressed with how real they look . I'm going to check out Michaels myself this week to see what they have. <br>\nSeeing all your stuff makes me feel excited .....You should definitely start a planning thread <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tegz1177@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.148.28.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422551835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281944.jpg?_r=1422582035","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":289,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Teg07","Id":281944,"Name":"Teg07","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1423589965,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"052fa5837f56b17ab89fe728b5ce6e0d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Teg07\" post=\"1885955\" timestamp=\"1423611770\"]\n@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] - The tables look wonderful ! My cousin used those lanterns from ikea at her wedding and I have it as a momento. :)\nAs for the flowers ...they also look great. I&#039;m impressed with how real they look . I&#039;m going to check out Michaels myself this week to see what they have.\nSeeing all your stuff makes me feel excited .....You should definitely start a planning thread :)[\/quote]Thanks! yeah I really loved those Moroccan looking lanterns that i&#039;ve seen on blogs but I couldn&#039;t find any that wouldn&#039;t blow my budget for centerpieces so the ikea ones will do. I think they look nice, and yeah, people can either take them or I&#039;m sure I can find a place to put them afterwards in my new home :)\n\nMichaels has tons of really nice flowers that look pretty real on pictures. Those ones came as a bouquet, the blush and ivory ones. They&#039;re not with the rest of their stems. At least the one I go to has a section with garlands and things like that and that&#039;s where they are. They usually have bouquets with different colors :). Usually what I do is I comb through the store to get ideas and find the craziest things. It&#039;s very time consuming, but I have fun haha. \n\nI finally put my procrastination and insecurities aside and started a planning thread. It&#039;s where all the other planning threads are :D. I haven&#039;t added anything on decor, but maybe I&#039;ll find some time tonight to keep writing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885967,"PostDate":1423589904,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Teg07, on Today, 03:42 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> - The tables look wonderful ! My cousin used those lanterns from ikea at her wedding and I have it as a momento. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>\nAs for the flowers ...they also look great. I'm impressed with how real they look . I'm going to check out Michaels myself this week to see what they have.<br>\nSeeing all your stuff makes me feel excited .....You should definitely start a planning thread <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks! yeah I really loved those Moroccan looking lanterns that i've seen on blogs but I couldn't find any that wouldn't blow my budget for centerpieces so the ikea ones will do. I think they look nice, and yeah, people can either take them or I'm sure I can find a place to put them afterwards in my new home <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Michaels has tons of really nice flowers that look pretty real on pictures. Those ones came as a bouquet, the blush and ivory ones. They're not with the rest of their stems. At least the one I go to has a section with garlands and things like that and that's where they are. They usually have bouquets with different colors <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. Usually what I do is I comb through the store to get ideas and find the craziest things. It's very time consuming, but I have fun haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I finally put my procrastination and insecurities aside and started a planning thread. It's where all the other planning threads are <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>. I haven't added anything on decor, but maybe I'll find some time tonight to keep writing.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359734304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1404747402","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
