{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78697,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"827d2cac5d1a446f00c7bb9e680cea9b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow.. that&#039;s a pretty awesome upgrade! :) &amp;nbsp;Air Canada I assume?\n\nWe&#039;re flying Transat&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885588,"PostDate":1423327384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow.. that's a pretty awesome upgrade! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Air Canada I assume?<br>\nWe're flying Transat<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419409014,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1419972184","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78697,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1423328136,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"602e7dddb44a671b16b96249329ede55","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885588\" timestamp=\"1423356184\"]\nWow.. that&#039;s a pretty awesome upgrade! :)  Air Canada I assume?\nWe&#039;re flying Transat\n\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"][\/quote]\nYes it was with Air Canada Vacations.\n\nWe had another bride on our flight who wasn&#039;t in first class. Unsure if she didn&#039;t want it, if maybe it had sold out before they booked, or maybe she didn&#039;t have enough people booked to qualify.  I know it was based on availability.  We had booked our package in May, but our TA secured the seats in first class in early July.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885589,"PostDate":1423328094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 07 February 2015 - 04:43 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow.. that's a pretty awesome upgrade! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Air Canada I assume?<br>\nWe're flying Transat<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes it was with Air Canada Vacations.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We had another bride on our flight who wasn't in first class. Unsure if she didn't want it, if maybe it had sold out before they booked, or maybe she didn't have enough people booked to qualify. \u00a0I know it was based on availability. \u00a0We had booked our package in May, but our TA secured the seats in first class in early July.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78697,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84e3709c3ddb489cf2e199c737f47289","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1885589\" timestamp=\"1423356894\"]\nYes it was with Air Canada Vacations.\n\nWe had another bride on our flight who wasn&#039;t in first class. Unsure if she didn&#039;t want it, if maybe it had sold out before they booked, or maybe she didn&#039;t have enough people booked to qualify.  I know it was based on availability.  We had booked our package in May, but our TA secured the seats in first class in early July.[\/quote]Oh that&#039;s really great! Air Transat won&#039;t have first class since it&#039;s a chartered airline. I just hope they are a bit more lenient about my luggage capacity haha. I&#039;m a super heavy packer in general.. I like to take my whole closet on vacation &#039;just in case&#039;.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885596,"PostDate":1423336677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 07 February 2015 - 04:54 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Yes it was with Air Canada Vacations.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We had another bride on our flight who wasn't in first class. Unsure if she didn't want it, if maybe it had sold out before they booked, or maybe she didn't have enough people booked to qualify. \u00a0I know it was based on availability. \u00a0We had booked our package in May, but our TA secured the seats in first class in early July.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Oh that's really great! Air Transat won't have first class since it's a chartered airline. I just hope they are a bit more lenient about my luggage capacity haha. I'm a super heavy packer in general.. I like to take my whole closet on vacation 'just in case'.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419409014,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1419972184","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.183.193.17","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78697,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c8f4b4b21adb158d3903f8b7ed18043","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LisaAnthonyPoppy\" post=\"1885511\" timestamp=\"1423267322\"]\nI&#039;m actually bringing 30 charger plates :) lol[\/quote]\nWhat is a charger plate?  :blink:","Attachments":[],"Id":1885914,"PostDate":1423569131,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LisaAnthonyPoppy, on 06 February 2015 - 04:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm actually bringing 30 charger plates <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> lol<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What is a charger plate?\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/blink.png' class='bbc_e